Age Restrictions for Slendy Monkeys - 
Slendy Monkeys Is Based Of A Game That Is Meant For 13+ Users Due To The Possibly Disturbing Imagery. If Given Parental Permission A Child Under The Age Of 13 Could Play Slendy Monkeys With User Discretion.
Slendy Monkeys Is Available For The Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest Pro, And Quest 3s.
Personal Data Collection - 
Due To The Service Slendy Monkeys Uses For Banning, Reporting, And Stuff Like It Admins and Mods Can See Your City, Country, Your Ingame Username, And When You Logged On.
Usage Of Data - 
Hardware Software May Be Used To Determine If Slendy Monkeys Is Playable On The User's Headset.
Data Is Not Collected, Or Deleted By Slendy Monkeys Or Any Third Party Service. Slendy Monkeys Stores Your City Location, And When You Logged On. Along With Your Username.
